      "message": "We create an instance of `ConcurrentBloomFilter` (line 377) before we make sure that the schema exists. Maybe this is currently not an issue because of how `ConcurrentBloomFilter` is coded, but if it starts building from its constructor then this may become an issue.\n\nI propose to first `createSchema` and then instantiate bloom filter.",
